  "welcome.finish": "Finish",
  "welcome.dont_show_again": "Don't show this wizard again",
  "welcome.page1.content": "Welcome to MouseMacros! This is a free, open-source mouse and keyboard macro recording tool.\n\nBy recording your actions, MouseMacros can help you:\n• Automate repetitive tasks\n• Improve work efficiency\n• Reduce manual operation errors\n\nThis wizard will guide you through the basic features. Click \"Next\" to continue.",
  "welcome.page2.title": "Basic Operations",
  "welcome.page2.content": "Using MouseMacros is simple:\n\n1️⃣ Record a Macro:\n   • Press the record hotkey (default F9)\n   • Perform the mouse and keyboard actions you want to record\n   • Press the stop recording hotkey (default F10)\n\n2️⃣ Play a Macro:\n   • Press the play hotkey (default F11)\n   • The program will automatically repeat your recorded actions\n   • Press the abort hotkey (default F12) to stop anytime\n\n3️⃣ Save/Load:\n   • Use the \"Save Macro\" and \"Load Macro\" buttons in the main interface\n   • You can save multiple different macro files",
  "welcome.page3.title": "Hotkey Setup",
  "welcome.page3.content": "You can customize all hotkeys:\n\n• Click the \"Settings\" button in the main interface\n• Select \"Custom Hotkey\"\n• Click the input field, then press the key you want to set\n• Click \"Confirm\" to save\n\n⚠️ Notes:\n• Avoid using media keys (volume, playback, etc.), as they may not record properly\n• Recommended: F1-F12 or letter keys + Ctrl/Shift/Alt combinations\n• Ensure hotkeys don't conflict with other programs",
  "welcome.page4.title": "Get Started",
  "welcome.page4.content": "You're ready to start using MouseMacros!\n\n💡 Tips:\n• For your first recording, try simple actions as a test\n• Enable \"Quick Mode\" in settings to ignore action delays\n• Check logs or visit GitHub for support if you encounter issues\n\n📚 More Help:\n• GitHub: github.com/Samera2022/MouseMacros\n• Bilibili: UID 583460263\n\nThank you for choosing MouseMacros!"
